{"speciesId":91,"names":{"fr":"Crustabri","es":"Cloyster","en":"Cloyster","ja":"パルシェン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"When attacked, it launches its horns in quick volleys. Its innards have never been seen."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"When attacked, it launches its horns in quick volleys. Its innards have never been seen."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"For protection, it uses its harder- than-diamonds shell. It also shoots spikes from the shell."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Once it slams its shell shut, it is impossible to open, even by those with superi­ or strength."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"CLOYSTER that live in seas with harsh tidal currents grow large, sharp spikes on their shells."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Even a missile can't break the spikes it uses to stab opponents. They're even hard­ er than its shell."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"CLOYSTER is capable of swimming in the sea. It does so by swallowing water, then jetting it out toward the rear. This POKéMON shoots spikes from its shell using the same system."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"CLOYSTER is capable of swimming in the sea. It does so by swallowing water, then jetting it out toward the rear. This POKéMON shoots spikes from its shell using the same system."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It swims in the sea by swallowing water, then jetting it out toward the rear. The CLOYSTER shoots spikes from its shell using the same system."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its shell is extremely hard. It cannot be shattered, even with a bomb. The shell opens only when it is attacking."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"When attacked, it launches its horns in quick volleys. Its innards have never been seen."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Once it slams its shell shut, it is impossible to open, even by those with superior strength."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"CLOYSTER that live in seas with harsh tidal currents grow large, sharp spikes on their shells."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il se défend en fermant sa coquille et projette des piquants qui repoussent ses agresseurs."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il se défend en fermant sa coquille et projette des piquants qui repoussent ses agresseurs."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les Crustabri vivant dans des mers aux courants forts développent des dards sur leur coquille."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"A los Cloyster que viven en las fuertes corrientes marinas les crecen largas y afiladas púas en la concha."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Cloyster that live in seas with harsh tidal currents grow large, sharp spikes on their shells."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"潮の 流れが 激しい 海に 生息している パルシェンの 殻の トゲは 大きく 鋭い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa coquille est extrêmement résistante. Rien ne peut la détruire, pas même une bombe. Il ne l’ouvre que lorsqu’il attaque."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La concha que lo cubre es extremadamente dura. No es posible causarle rasguños y solo se abre si lo atacan."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its shell is extremely hard. It cannot be shattered, even with a bomb. The shell opens only when it is attacking."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"殻が 非常に 硬く ナパーム弾でも 壊せない。 攻撃するときだけ 開く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Crustabri est capable de se déplacer dans les fonds marins en avalant de l’eau et en la rejetant vers l’arrière. Ce Pokémon envoie des pointes en utilisant la même méthode."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cloyster es capaz de nadar por el mar. Su técnica consiste en tragar agua y expulsarla por el conducto que tiene en la parte trasera. Este mismo sistema es el que usa para lanzar los pinchos que tiene alrededor de la concha."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cloyster is capable of swimming in the sea. It does so by swallowing water, then jetting it out toward the rear. This Pokémon shoots spikes from its shell using the same system."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"飲み込んだ 海水を 後ろへ 勢い よく 噴射する ことで 海の 中を 泳ぐ。 トゲを 発射する 仕組みも 同じ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Crustabri est capable de se déplacer dans les fonds marins en avalant de l’eau et en la rejetant vers l’arrière. Ce Pokémon envoie des pointes en utilisant la même méthode."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cloyster es capaz de nadar por el mar. Su técnica consiste en tragar agua y expulsarla por el conducto que tiene en la parte trasera. Este mismo sistema es el que usa para lanzar los pinchos que tiene alrededor de la concha."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cloyster is capable of swimming in the sea. It does so by swallowing water, then jetting it out toward the rear. This Pokémon shoots spikes from its shell using the same system."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"飲み込んだ 海水を 後ろへ 勢い よく 噴射する ことで 海の 中を 泳ぐ。 トゲを 発射する 仕組みも 同じ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Sa carapace peut même résister à une bombe au napalm. Personne ne sait ce qu’elle dissimule."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Su dura concha es capaz de aguantar el impacto de una bomba. La forma de su cuerpo, oculto en el interior, sigue siendo un misterio."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its hard shell cannot be shattered—not even by a bomb. The contents of the shell remain unknown."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"硬い殻は ナパーム弾 でも 砕けない。 カラの 中味の 正体は 未だ 不明。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Les archéologues qui explorent les tombes de chasseurs primitifs trouvent souvent des lances faites avec des épines tombées de sa carapace."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se han desenterrado numerosas lanzas hechas con pinchos de la concha de Cloyster. Eran utilizadas por antiguos pueblos de cazadores."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Excavation of the tombs of ancient hunting tribes has turned up many spears tipped with spikes that had fallen off this Pokémon’s shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"殻から 抜けた トゲで 造った ヤリが 狩猟民族の 古墳から たくさん 出土する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il a une coquille à toute épreuve. En cicatrisant, les blessures sur ses valves forment des excroissances qui évoluent en dards pointus."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Su concha es increíblemente dura. Las heridas que recibe en la misma, al cicatrizar, generan enormes púas afiladas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"If areas of Cloyster’s very hard shell get damaged, those areas swell, gradually growing into large sharp spikes."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"とても 硬いカラを 持つ。 カラに ついた キズは 次第に 盛り上がり 大きく 鋭いトゲへと 育つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il raffole tant des queues de Ramoloss qu’il lui arrive de ramper jusqu’à la terre ferme pour rechercher son péché mignon."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Las colas de Slowpoke le gustan tanto que en ocasiones llega incluso a aventurarse en tierra firme en busca de este Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Slowpoke tails are its favorite food. It has even been known to come up on land to look for Slowpoke from time to time."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ヤドンの シッポが 大好物。 ときには 陸に はいあがってまで ヤドンを 探すことも あるほど。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Sa coquille, plus dure que le diamant, le protège. Elle peut aussi envoyer de redoutables volées de dards."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Se protege con su concha, que es más dura que un diamante. Su capacidad de lanzar pinchos lo convierte en un rival temible."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"For protection, it uses its harder-than-diamond shell. It also shoots spikes from the shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"ダイヤモンドよりも 硬いカラで 守るだけでなく ついている トゲを 飛ばしてくるので かなり 手ごわい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Sa coquille, plus dure que le diamant, le protège. Elle peut aussi envoyer de redoutables volées de dards."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Se protege con su concha, que es más dura que un diamante. Su capacidad de lanzar pinchos lo convierte en un rival temible."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"For protection, it uses its harder-than-diamond shell. It also shoots spikes from the shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"ダイヤモンドよりも 硬いカラで 守るだけでなく ついている トゲを 飛ばしてくるので かなり 手ごわい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Sa coquille est tellement résistante que rien ne peut la détruire, pas même une déflagration. Il ne l’ouvre que lorsqu’il attaque."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"La concha que lo cubre es extremadamente dura, hasta el punto de que ni siquiera una bomba puede destrozarla. Solo se abre cuando ataca."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its shell is extremely hard. It cannot be shattered, even with a bomb. The shell opens only when it is attacking."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"殻が 非常に 硬く ナパーム弾でも 壊せない。 攻撃するときだけ 開く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Quand il referme sa coquille, il est impossible de la rouvrir, même avec une force hors du commun."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Una vez que ha cerrado la concha, es imposible abrirla, independientemente de la fuerza que se ejerza."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Once it slams its shell shut, it is impossible to open, even by those with superior strength."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"いちど 殻を 閉じてしまうと どんな 怪力の 持ち主でも 開けることは 不可能だ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":91,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[19,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"twineedle","learns":[[19,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"pin-missile","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[19,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"supersonic","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",1]]}